WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.491
[PHOENIX] Illustrator Elise
Deauxnim was murdered

00:00:02.575 --> 00:00:03.908
at Hazakura Temple,

00:00:03.991 --> 00:00:06.866
an idyllic retreat where spirit
mediums come to train.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.950
But the first day of
her suspected killer's trial

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:11.116
ended with more
questions than answers.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.950
Further investigation
revealed secrets

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:14.491
about the murder.

00:00:14.575 --> 00:00:16.783
Firstly, the crime took place
at the remote Inner Temple,

00:00:16.866 --> 00:00:18.908
not on the grounds
of the main Temple.

00:00:18.991 --> 00:00:21.658
Also, the victim was,
in fact, Misty Fey.

00:00:21.741 --> 00:00:25.325
Maya and Mia's mother who had
not been seen in 17 years.

00:00:25.408 --> 00:00:28.408
And, Iris was the twin
sister of Dahlia Hawthorne,

00:00:28.491 --> 00:00:31.866
who just last month had been
executed for her crimes.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.075
The most bone chilling
truth uncovered, though,

00:00:34.158 --> 00:00:36.366
was that little Pearl played
an unwitting accomplice

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.825
in her aunt's murder.

00:00:37.908 --> 00:00:40.158
The one pulling the strings
behind this fiendish plot

00:00:40.241 --> 00:00:42.783
was her mother, Morgan Fey.

00:00:42.866 --> 00:00:45.241
Her objective was to
wipe out the main bloodline

00:00:45.325 --> 00:00:46.950
of the Kurain School.

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:49.116
And throughout all of this,
Maya has been trapped

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.033
in the sacred cavern.

00:00:51.116 --> 00:00:53.491
Oh. I hope she's okay!

00:02:28.866 --> 00:02:30.991
So, it's still locked?

00:02:31.075 --> 00:02:34.408
And poor Mystic Maya is still
trapped in the Sacred Cavern?

00:02:34.491 --> 00:02:37.116
[PHOENIX] Mm-hmm. But Iris
is working hard to open

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.283
all those trick locks, so...

00:02:39.366 --> 00:02:42.658
[MILES] If you're talking
about Sister Iris,

00:02:42.741 --> 00:02:44.075
she's here at the courthouse.

00:02:44.158 --> 00:02:45.408
Wait, what's she doing here?

00:02:45.491 --> 00:02:48.075
Discussing her testimony
with the prosecution team.

00:02:48.158 --> 00:02:50.075
Really? She's taking the stand?

00:02:50.158 --> 00:02:52.158
Um, sir? Mystic Maya...

00:02:52.241 --> 00:02:53.491
Is she okay?

00:02:53.575 --> 00:02:55.075
Don't you worry.

00:02:55.158 --> 00:02:57.991
We have somebody else working on
the locks while Iris is here.

00:02:58.075 --> 00:02:59.033
Who's that?

00:02:59.116 --> 00:03:00.866
Franziska is there.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:03.241
She chose not to sleep
and has been at it all night

00:03:03.325 --> 00:03:05.658
with guidance
from sister Bikini.

00:03:05.741 --> 00:03:09.033
[PHOENIX gasps]
So, the trial today.

00:03:09.116 --> 00:03:10.825
Someone else is handling it.

00:03:10.908 --> 00:03:12.908
Godot, I believe?

00:03:12.991 --> 00:03:16.200
[PHOENIX sighs]
I was afraid of that.

00:03:16.283 --> 00:03:20.033
[MILES] Hmph. I'm going now. I
suppose the rest is up to you...

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:21.241
...partner.

00:03:21.325 --> 00:03:24.200
Right. I came here to win!

00:03:24.283 --> 00:03:25.491
[PEARL sighs]

00:03:28.866 --> 00:03:32.783
[PHOENIX] I'm walking headfirst
into the final showdown!

00:03:32.866 --> 00:03:34.491
This is for you, Maya!

00:03:39.408 --> 00:03:40.866
Good morning.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.075
Court is now back in session
for the trial of Sister Iris.

00:03:44.158 --> 00:03:46.616
Hang on. Why are you here?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.825
My little brother had a fever
so bad he fainted from it,

00:03:49.908 --> 00:03:51.241
so I'll be hearing the case.

00:03:51.325 --> 00:03:53.241
[PHOENIX]
They're brothers. Ahh.

00:03:53.325 --> 00:03:56.158
Prosecutor Godot,
your opening statement, please.

00:03:56.241 --> 00:03:59.783
[GODOT] One's heart can change
as the clouds move overhead.

00:03:59.866 --> 00:04:04.366
In this mixed-up world,
there's only one constant.

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:08.158
There's a darkness underneath.
Complex and bitter. But still...

00:04:08.241 --> 00:04:09.700
...tasty.

00:04:09.783 --> 00:04:12.158
[PHOENIX] Can you just
say it in plain English?

00:04:12.241 --> 00:04:13.366
To put it more simply,

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:14.991
I'm announcing that
the prosecution's plans

00:04:15.075 --> 00:04:16.158
have changed.

00:04:16.241 --> 00:04:17.658
In earlier proceedings.

00:04:17.741 --> 00:04:20.700
the accused refused to admit
she had a role in the crime.

00:04:20.783 --> 00:04:24.116
But as the clouds have shifted,
she's had a change of heart.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.116
[gasps]

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.908
And her confession today

00:04:26.991 --> 00:04:29.825
will illuminate what was
once shrouded in darkness.

00:04:29.908 --> 00:04:31.533
[PHOENIX]
Confession?

00:04:31.616 --> 00:04:35.158
Why couldn't she have told me
about this last night?

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:36.741
[PEARL gasps]

00:04:36.825 --> 00:04:38.908
[GODOT] Besides my curiosity,
the present situation requires

00:04:38.991 --> 00:04:41.408
that I ask your name
and occupation.

00:04:41.491 --> 00:04:43.075
Yes, my name is Iris.

00:04:43.158 --> 00:04:46.866
And I am but a simple nun
serving at the Hazakura Temple.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:49.200
Iris. What do you
need to confess?

00:04:49.283 --> 00:04:50.991
I hope you'll forgive me.

00:04:51.075 --> 00:04:54.408
But I can no longer
continue to lie to everyone.

00:04:54.491 --> 00:04:57.741
The truth is, I did have
a hand in this terrible tragedy.

00:04:57.825 --> 00:05:00.950
[JUDGE gasps] Young lady,
please explain yourself.

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:04.158
Are you confessing to the
murder of Ms. Elise Deauxnim?

00:05:04.241 --> 00:05:07.325
Not that, but I did play
a major part in the cover-up.

00:05:07.408 --> 00:05:09.741
[PHOENIX gasps]
What cover up?

00:05:09.825 --> 00:05:11.408
I gathered her lifeless body,

00:05:11.491 --> 00:05:14.491
and transported it to
the main temple's courtyard.

00:05:14.575 --> 00:05:16.700
Then... I desecrated it.

00:05:16.783 --> 00:05:17.950
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:20.075
[JUDGE]
And this was all your doing?

00:05:20.158 --> 00:05:22.700
[IRIS]
Yes. I did it to cover for her.

00:05:22.783 --> 00:05:25.325
Hold on a second!
What's that mean?

00:05:25.408 --> 00:05:26.908
Who are you covering for?

00:05:26.991 --> 00:05:29.116
[IRIS]
Someone who I had to protect.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.450
Even if it meant putting my
own freedom in jeopardy.

00:05:32.533 --> 00:05:34.033
It was the Master
of the Kurain School

00:05:34.116 --> 00:05:37.283
of channeling's daughter,
Mystic Maya Fey.

00:05:37.366 --> 00:05:38.575
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:05:38.658 --> 00:05:40.158
No! That's insane!

00:05:40.241 --> 00:05:42.700
She's no killer. You're lying!

00:05:42.783 --> 00:05:44.075
[JUDGE]
Overruled.

00:05:44.158 --> 00:05:46.950
We must let the witness
give her testimony, defense.

00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:48.033
[PHOENIX growls]

00:05:49.991 --> 00:05:52.908
That night, I did go over
to the Inner Temple

00:05:52.991 --> 00:05:55.700
to relieve Sister Bikini
for a while and assist

00:05:55.783 --> 00:05:58.450
Mystic Maya with
her training as well.

00:05:58.533 --> 00:06:01.408
[PHOENIX] But in your previous
testimony, you told the court

00:06:01.491 --> 00:06:03.700
that you never went to
the Inner Temple that night!

00:06:03.783 --> 00:06:06.075
I did, but that's
because I was lying

00:06:06.158 --> 00:06:09.366
in order to protect Mystic Maya.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:12.241
After she had finished
preparations for her training,

00:06:12.325 --> 00:06:13.908
she passed through the garden.

00:06:13.991 --> 00:06:16.116
Then, Elise showed up out of
nowhere and just started

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.866
attacking her with her staff!

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.033
[MAYA gasps]

00:06:19.116 --> 00:06:21.033
[IRIS]
As Maya stumbled away in terror,

00:06:21.116 --> 00:06:22.658
Elise threw the staff
down in the snow,

00:06:22.741 --> 00:06:24.325
and pulled a dagger
from her robe.

00:06:24.408 --> 00:06:25.533
[MAYA gasps]

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.700
[MAYA gasps]

00:06:29.783 --> 00:06:31.491
[IRIS] Maya desperately tried to
take control of the situation

00:06:31.575 --> 00:06:32.991
and stole the weapon
from her hands.

00:06:33.075 --> 00:06:34.408
[MAYA whimpers]

00:06:34.491 --> 00:06:36.616
She was only
trying to defend herself!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.075
--[CROWD gasping]
--[PHOENIX] Hmm...

00:06:39.158 --> 00:06:42.033
[IRIS] Elise was going
to kill her in cold blood!

00:06:42.116 --> 00:06:43.408
That's why I did it.

00:06:43.491 --> 00:06:46.116
All I wanted to do was
protect poor Mystic Maya!

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.116
And if you moved
the body across the gorge

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.991
to the Hazakura Temple,

00:06:50.075 --> 00:06:52.741
nobody would suspect
that Maya was involved.

00:06:52.825 --> 00:06:54.825
I'd say you brewed
up a pretty solid plan.

00:06:54.908 --> 00:06:57.200
[PHOENIX]
Iris... I can't imagine

00:06:57.283 --> 00:07:00.200
what your true motivation
must be with this,

00:07:00.283 --> 00:07:02.825
but your testimony has
one glaring contradiction.

00:07:02.908 --> 00:07:04.075
[gasps]

00:07:04.158 --> 00:07:05.950
Elise would not have
thrown her staff aside

00:07:06.033 --> 00:07:09.575
to attack. This thing
has its own secret.

00:07:09.658 --> 00:07:10.741
[IRIS gasps]

00:07:12.325 --> 00:07:13.325
[gasping]

00:07:13.408 --> 00:07:16.616
My god! Is that blood?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:17.908
[PEARL gasps]

00:07:17.991 --> 00:07:21.033
Defense. Can you tell us
whose blood that is?

00:07:21.116 --> 00:07:23.783
[PHOENIX] There's a sample
being analyzed as we speak.

00:07:23.866 --> 00:07:26.450
But Sister Iris testified that
Elise threw this sword away

00:07:26.533 --> 00:07:29.575
in favor of a dagger,
which makes no sense!

00:07:29.658 --> 00:07:31.825
It's compounded by the
simple fact that Elise Deauxnim

00:07:31.908 --> 00:07:34.325
would never try to
murder Maya Fey!

00:07:34.408 --> 00:07:36.033
[GODOT]
How can you be sure?

00:07:36.116 --> 00:07:37.950
I say "Elise Deauxnim,"
but that was just

00:07:38.033 --> 00:07:42.533
a clever pseudonym.
Her real name was Misty Fey.

00:07:42.616 --> 00:07:43.533
[CROWD gasping]

00:07:43.616 --> 00:07:44.533
Misty Fey?

00:07:44.616 --> 00:07:45.866
[gasps]
It can't be!

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:47.741
Master of the Kurain school.

00:07:47.825 --> 00:07:49.658
A woman who'd been
neither seen nor heard from

00:07:49.741 --> 00:07:52.658
in well over 15 years.
And what's more...

00:07:52.741 --> 00:07:56.200
Besides being Kurain's master,
she was also Maya Fey's mother!

00:07:56.283 --> 00:07:57.200
[JUDGE]
Are you serious?

00:07:57.283 --> 00:07:58.908
No way... There's no way...

00:07:58.991 --> 00:08:00.616
What?! Mystic Misty?!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.408
[PHOENIX] Why would she
try to kill her daughter,

00:08:02.491 --> 00:08:05.200
who she hadn't seen
in so many years?

00:08:05.283 --> 00:08:08.533
There's just no reason!
You can't give me a single one!

00:08:08.616 --> 00:08:10.283
--[screams]
--[CROWD gasping]

00:08:10.366 --> 00:08:12.491
[JUDGE]
Order! Order in this court!

00:08:12.575 --> 00:08:16.658
[GODOT] Well... Who can
really say with family?

00:08:16.741 --> 00:08:18.616
But when we went back
and investigated the garden

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.950
of the Inner Temple, we
discovered something that

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:23.658
backs up the sister's testimony.

00:08:23.741 --> 00:08:25.991
The tip is completely
covered in blood.

00:08:26.075 --> 00:08:29.325
Forensics is processing
a sample from this as well.

00:08:29.408 --> 00:08:32.033
I see. Are you saying this
was the murder weapon?

00:08:32.116 --> 00:08:34.200
[GODOT] That is what
the prosecution believes.

00:08:34.283 --> 00:08:35.200
[PHOENIX growls]

00:08:35.283 --> 00:08:37.200
[JUDGE]
This crime scene photo.

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:39.825
There's something
rather odd about it.

00:08:39.908 --> 00:08:42.658
Why was the snow cleared
out around the lantern?

00:08:42.741 --> 00:08:43.991
[PHOENIX sighs]

00:08:44.075 --> 00:08:45.866
[JUDGE] And there seems
to be something scrawled

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:47.450
on the lantern itself.

00:08:47.533 --> 00:08:48.991
[GODOT]
Huh?

00:08:49.075 --> 00:08:52.700
[JUDGE] My goodness!
It looks like a bloody message!

00:08:52.783 --> 00:08:55.075
Like someone wrote
"Maya" backwards.

00:08:55.158 --> 00:08:56.991
See? I wasn't lying!

00:08:57.075 --> 00:08:59.908
After Elise was stabbed, she
reached out behind her and wrote

00:08:59.991 --> 00:09:02.908
the killer's name
in her own blood!

00:09:02.991 --> 00:09:04.825
There's the proof!

00:09:04.908 --> 00:09:06.950
[PHOENIX]
Crap! I forgot all about that!

00:09:07.033 --> 00:09:10.366
[GODOT]
Hold it! Hang on just a minute.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:11.741
What are you all seeing?

00:09:11.825 --> 00:09:14.533
There are backwards letters
written on the stone?

00:09:14.616 --> 00:09:16.366
It's right in front
of our faces.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.658
The center of the frame.

00:09:17.741 --> 00:09:19.700
[GODOT grunts]
Nonsense.

00:09:19.783 --> 00:09:21.408
Do you really expect me to
believe that there's something

00:09:21.491 --> 00:09:22.741
written on that thing?

00:09:22.825 --> 00:09:23.991
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:09:24.075 --> 00:09:27.033
[PHOENIX] Is he joking,
or can he not see it?

00:09:27.116 --> 00:09:28.741
[JUDGE]
Regardless, this is a very

00:09:28.825 --> 00:09:30.991
important clue, Prosecutor.

00:09:31.075 --> 00:09:32.158
What do you say?

00:09:32.241 --> 00:09:33.575
[GODOT growls]

00:09:33.658 --> 00:09:34.866
[JUDGE]
Prosecutor Godot?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:37.825
Yeah. O-Okay, witness.

00:09:37.908 --> 00:09:39.366
Shall we move on?

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.658
[PHOENIX] He looks like he's
sweating bullets over there.

00:09:43.116 --> 00:09:46.033
When it was done,
I fulfilled my duty.

00:09:46.116 --> 00:09:48.366
I believed the most important
thing was to protect

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:50.491
the future master
of the Kurain School.

00:09:50.575 --> 00:09:53.075
And so we decided I would
use the snowmobile to move

00:09:53.158 --> 00:09:55.075
the body to the main temple.

00:09:55.158 --> 00:09:57.700
[GODOT] Yeah. There were
clear snowmobile tracks

00:09:57.783 --> 00:10:01.033
leading from Dusky Bridge
to Hazakura Temple.

00:10:01.116 --> 00:10:03.158
Did you just say
that the tracks were clear?

00:10:03.241 --> 00:10:04.450
Oh, yes.

00:10:04.533 --> 00:10:06.658
By the time I carried
her body to the bridge.

00:10:06.741 --> 00:10:08.575
The snow had already
stopped falling.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:11.741
[PHOENIX]
So there was no more snow?

00:10:11.825 --> 00:10:13.491
Are you absolutely certain?

00:10:13.575 --> 00:10:16.616
[IRIS] Uh... Yes.
There's no doubt in my mind.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.158
Objection!

00:10:18.241 --> 00:10:19.950
[IRIS screams]

00:10:20.033 --> 00:10:22.075
[PHOENIX] That statement
is patently false!

00:10:22.158 --> 00:10:23.116
[gasps]

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.950
That night,
the snow didn't stop

00:10:25.033 --> 00:10:27.491
falling until 10:50 PM.

00:10:27.575 --> 00:10:30.241
But at 10:45,
an exceptionally noteworthy

00:10:30.325 --> 00:10:32.283
event took place.

00:10:32.366 --> 00:10:33.366
What are you talking about?

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.700
Oh, yeah.

00:10:34.783 --> 00:10:35.700
[IRIS gasps]

00:10:35.783 --> 00:10:36.783
You have to ask?

00:10:36.866 --> 00:10:38.908
Gotta say, I'm surprised
you didn't know.

00:10:38.991 --> 00:10:40.950
That's when the lightning
strike hit the bridge!

00:10:41.033 --> 00:10:43.033
Uh, lightning strike?

00:10:43.116 --> 00:10:45.616
So there's no way you
moved the body like you claim!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.033
--I--
--[PHOENIX] No.

00:10:47.116 --> 00:10:48.491
Because by that time,

00:10:48.575 --> 00:10:51.491
Dusky Bridge was already
consumed by flames!

00:10:51.575 --> 00:10:52.825
[gasps]

00:10:52.908 --> 00:10:54.408
In other words,

00:10:54.491 --> 00:10:58.075
this means your testimony is a
complete and utter fabrication!

00:10:58.158 --> 00:10:59.075
[IRIS whimpers]

00:10:59.158 --> 00:11:01.366
[shrieks]

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.075
[CROWD murmuring]

00:11:03.158 --> 00:11:06.658
[PHOENIX] She's trying to
frame Maya for the murder.

00:11:06.741 --> 00:11:09.033
What I wanna know... is why?

00:11:09.616 --> 00:11:13.241
[CROWD murmuring]

00:11:13.325 --> 00:11:16.825
Young lady. Lying under
oath is a serious crime!

00:11:16.908 --> 00:11:19.533
You can be charged
with contempt of court!

00:11:19.616 --> 00:11:21.158
The snow stopped
five minutes after

00:11:21.241 --> 00:11:23.325
the lightning strike?

00:11:23.408 --> 00:11:26.200
Pfft. Don't make me laugh.

00:11:26.283 --> 00:11:29.325
The weather in the mountains is
as fickle as a maiden's heart.

00:11:29.408 --> 00:11:31.325
It can unexpectedly
change from one moment

00:11:31.408 --> 00:11:32.700
to the next.

00:11:32.783 --> 00:11:35.491
He's right, you know!
Just like a maiden's heart!

00:11:35.575 --> 00:11:37.533
Oh, you have
gotta be kidding me!

00:11:37.616 --> 00:11:39.991
The point is, on the
night of the murder,

00:11:40.075 --> 00:11:43.325
the victim's body was indeed
moved to Hazakura Temple.

00:11:43.408 --> 00:11:45.783
That fact is not in contention.

00:11:45.866 --> 00:11:47.658
But can you provide
a better explanation

00:11:47.741 --> 00:11:49.575
for how it got there?

00:11:49.658 --> 00:11:52.866
[IRIS] Yeah! Or are you
trying to tell us her corpse

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:55.450
jumped across the burning
bridge on its own?

00:11:55.533 --> 00:11:57.616
[PHOENIX] I don't know
what happened exactly.

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:00.491
But the body did make it
across the ravine somehow.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.325
Think of something.

00:12:03.408 --> 00:12:06.325
[JUDGE] The bridge was
definitely burned to a crisp.

00:12:06.408 --> 00:12:09.658
And it would appear that one
of the suspension wires is gone.

00:12:09.741 --> 00:12:11.033
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:12:11.116 --> 00:12:15.116
[PHOENIX] Is that it?
Could that be what happened?

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:18.533
No answer, huh?
If you have no explanation,

00:12:18.616 --> 00:12:21.283
then it's abundantly clear that
you don't have a leg to stand on

00:12:21.366 --> 00:12:23.950
when you call
Sister Iris a liar!

00:12:24.033 --> 00:12:25.450
Objection!

00:12:25.533 --> 00:12:26.450
[GODOT grunts]

00:12:26.533 --> 00:12:28.158
[screams]

00:12:28.241 --> 00:12:29.908
A corpse jumping
over a burning bridge

00:12:29.991 --> 00:12:33.241
seems impossible.
But believe it or not...

00:12:33.325 --> 00:12:34.575
...it could happen.

00:12:34.658 --> 00:12:37.450
[GODOT] Tch. Do you really
believe that's possible?

00:12:37.533 --> 00:12:39.450
Well... Okay.

00:12:39.533 --> 00:12:41.408
What I can't swallow is
how you'd back that up.

00:12:41.491 --> 00:12:44.950
It's not all that difficult.
Don't forget...

00:12:45.033 --> 00:12:47.408
...we do have
eyewitness testimony.

00:12:47.491 --> 00:12:48.950
What do you mean?

00:12:49.033 --> 00:12:52.575
[PHOENIX] I'm gonna have to
bulldoze my way through this.

00:12:52.658 --> 00:12:54.325
It was Laurice Deauxnim!

00:12:54.408 --> 00:12:57.991
Right? A potentially
brilliant artist!

00:12:58.075 --> 00:12:59.158
Brilliant?

00:12:59.241 --> 00:13:00.658
He's... an artist?

00:13:00.741 --> 00:13:02.616
Uh, don't see it.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:03.950
[CROWD murmuring]

00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:07.116
[PHOENIX] Ahem.
On the night of the murder,

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:09.700
he was staying in
a cabin very close by.

00:13:09.783 --> 00:13:10.950
And from there,

00:13:11.033 --> 00:13:13.158
he witnessed the
moment in question.

00:13:13.241 --> 00:13:15.283
I don't follow you. When?

00:13:16.783 --> 00:13:19.991
Look here. He actually drew
exactly what he saw that night.

00:13:20.075 --> 00:13:22.825
It's all on the page
in front of us!

00:13:22.908 --> 00:13:26.866
Defense. Are you proposing that
this rendering is accurate?

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.575
And these scribbles
prove the victim

00:13:28.658 --> 00:13:30.741
literally flew through the air?

00:13:30.825 --> 00:13:31.950
Yes!

00:13:32.033 --> 00:13:34.658
[GODOT] Hmph. You've
brewed up a full pot.

00:13:34.741 --> 00:13:36.325
You expect us to drink it down?

00:13:36.408 --> 00:13:39.241
The truth is here!
You can see it clearly.

00:13:39.325 --> 00:13:41.033
If you just change
your perspective!

00:13:41.116 --> 00:13:43.575
[GODOT]
Hmph. Spoon feed me, would ya?

00:13:43.658 --> 00:13:46.783
Just tell me what I'm
supposed to be seeing here.

00:13:46.866 --> 00:13:48.408
The piece of art
that Laurice Deauxnim

00:13:48.491 --> 00:13:51.950
created that night... couldn't
be more of a contradiction!

00:13:52.033 --> 00:13:53.491
[gasping]

00:13:53.575 --> 00:13:55.241
We're quite aware of that!

00:13:55.325 --> 00:13:58.033
Your Honor, I think
you misunderstand me.

00:13:58.116 --> 00:14:00.408
Take a look at this photo.

00:14:00.491 --> 00:14:04.033
The suspension
wires are below the bridge.

00:14:04.116 --> 00:14:06.200
But here, in this sketch,

00:14:06.283 --> 00:14:08.825
they appear to be
above the entire thing!

00:14:10.741 --> 00:14:13.950
[JUDGE] Hmm... Perhaps the
artist just saw it wrong?

00:14:14.033 --> 00:14:16.075
I think he probably
just drew it wrong.

00:14:16.158 --> 00:14:18.700
I think that you're
just wrong in the head.

00:14:18.783 --> 00:14:20.866
He drew it like he saw it.

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.741
So there has to be a reason for
this difference in perspective.

00:14:23.825 --> 00:14:24.991
[gasps]

00:14:25.075 --> 00:14:26.366
[PHOENIX] According to
the court transcript,

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:28.658
he was in the cabin
nearby, as he puts it,

00:14:28.741 --> 00:14:31.075
"cranking out a true work
of art, in my dreams."

00:14:31.158 --> 00:14:33.950
His dreams? Huh.

00:14:34.033 --> 00:14:35.450
At that moment,

00:14:35.533 --> 00:14:38.741
lightning shot from the sky
and set the bridge aflame.

00:14:38.825 --> 00:14:41.241
The whole thing happened
right before his eyes.

00:14:41.325 --> 00:14:42.700
However...

00:14:42.783 --> 00:14:44.450
...he was lying on his back!

00:14:44.533 --> 00:14:46.866
--[gasps]
--So what?

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:49.283
The fiery scene
that he saw that night

00:14:49.366 --> 00:14:51.950
was actually upside down!

00:14:52.033 --> 00:14:54.741
[GODOT] Heh. So that's what you
meant when you said we needed

00:14:54.825 --> 00:14:56.950
to "change our perspective."

00:14:57.033 --> 00:14:58.533
This looks quite different.

00:14:58.616 --> 00:15:01.533
The victim's body isn't
flying above the bridge.

00:15:01.616 --> 00:15:03.700
It's clearly swinging
underneath it!

00:15:03.783 --> 00:15:07.033
You see? Just like a pendulum!

00:15:08.991 --> 00:15:10.616
[GODOT]
Objection!

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:13.658
Dusky Bridge is about
20 meters long, you know?

00:15:13.741 --> 00:15:15.741
So where would somebody
just conveniently find

00:15:15.825 --> 00:15:17.741
a rope to swing across it?

00:15:17.825 --> 00:15:19.200
One couldn't be closer.

00:15:19.283 --> 00:15:20.200
[GODOT]
What?!

00:15:20.283 --> 00:15:21.908
[PHOENIX]
Don't you see it?

00:15:21.991 --> 00:15:24.033
[JUDGE]
The broken suspension wire?

00:15:24.116 --> 00:15:25.283
[gasps]

00:15:25.366 --> 00:15:27.075
When lightning
struck the bridge that night,

00:15:27.158 --> 00:15:29.700
one of the suspension
wires began to come loose

00:15:29.783 --> 00:15:31.700
from its anchor point.

00:15:31.783 --> 00:15:34.908
The culprit noticed this,
tied the body to it...

00:15:34.991 --> 00:15:36.616
...and then swung it across.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.033
[GODOT growls]

00:15:38.116 --> 00:15:39.366
[PHOENIX] They were completely
hell-bent on getting

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:42.158
the body over to
the main temple.

00:15:42.241 --> 00:15:43.408
But still...

00:15:43.491 --> 00:15:45.741
Since they couldn't
cross a burning bridge.

00:15:45.825 --> 00:15:48.033
This "pendulum" method
was the only way

00:15:48.116 --> 00:15:49.283
they could make that happen.

00:15:49.366 --> 00:15:50.283
[growls]

00:15:50.366 --> 00:15:54.575
[gulping]

00:15:54.658 --> 00:15:56.700
[coughs]

00:15:56.783 --> 00:15:59.200
[JUDGE]
Order! Order in the court!

00:15:59.283 --> 00:16:00.700
[IRIS]
Mister Wright!

00:16:00.783 --> 00:16:03.575
Do you have any proof that
the culprit did such a thing?

00:16:03.658 --> 00:16:05.283
Or are you just guessing?

00:16:05.366 --> 00:16:07.616
[PHOENIX]
Of course there's proof.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:10.158
It's right here. The police
said the corpse was covered

00:16:10.241 --> 00:16:12.908
with bruises consistent
with a high fall.

00:16:12.991 --> 00:16:16.575
After swinging over the gorge,
the body crashed to the ground.

00:16:16.658 --> 00:16:19.075
The resulting impact...

00:16:19.158 --> 00:16:21.325
...knocked this crystal
orb from the staff.

00:16:21.408 --> 00:16:24.075
[JUDGE] I believe the defense
has shown a plausible theory.

00:16:24.158 --> 00:16:26.450
Explaining how the
victim's body was moved.

00:16:26.533 --> 00:16:27.658
[GODOT]
Objection!

00:16:29.408 --> 00:16:30.950
[PHOENIX]
Uh...

00:16:32.741 --> 00:16:34.491
This cold cup of coffee
should help lower

00:16:34.575 --> 00:16:36.366
your temperature a little bit.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:38.908
Uh... What are you doing?

00:16:38.991 --> 00:16:43.116
[GODOT] A half-brewed deduction,
and still quite bitter, Trite.

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.616
You see, you forgot something.

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.408
[PHOENIX gasps]
Yeah? What?

00:16:47.491 --> 00:16:50.741
If the perpetrator swung
the body over like you say,

00:16:50.825 --> 00:16:54.491
then one might assume somebody
on the other side caught it.

00:16:54.575 --> 00:16:55.491
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:16:55.575 --> 00:16:57.700
Meaning they had an accomplice.

00:16:57.783 --> 00:16:59.325
Tell the court, Mister Blight.

00:16:59.408 --> 00:17:02.366
Who was there
to receive the body?

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.658
"Who was there?"

00:17:03.741 --> 00:17:07.116
Obviously... It could
only be you, Iris.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.908
Uh... It's me?

00:17:08.991 --> 00:17:10.658
[PHOENIX] The only way
to transport the body from

00:17:10.741 --> 00:17:13.741
Dusky Bridge was by snowmobile.

00:17:13.825 --> 00:17:17.075
Objection! Were you
listening to her testimony?

00:17:17.158 --> 00:17:19.366
This cutie pie was
helping Maya Fey.

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.616
Cleaning up the crime scene
at the inner temple.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:23.200
Which means...

00:17:23.283 --> 00:17:26.408
...she must've been the one who
sent the body swinging across.

00:17:26.491 --> 00:17:28.741
You're the one who
hasn't been listening.

00:17:28.825 --> 00:17:32.575
Sister Iris was later
seen at Hazakura Temple.

00:17:32.658 --> 00:17:34.075
And she admitted
to taking the body

00:17:34.158 --> 00:17:36.825
to the courtyard
to fake the crime scene.

00:17:36.908 --> 00:17:39.075
[CROWD gasping]

00:17:39.158 --> 00:17:41.825
[JUDGE]
Hmm... This is quite puzzling.

00:17:41.908 --> 00:17:44.533
It's almost as if the defendant
was in two different places

00:17:44.616 --> 00:17:46.200
at the same time.

00:17:48.616 --> 00:17:49.741
No objections!

00:17:49.825 --> 00:17:51.116
[gasping]

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:53.158
Uh... None? Really?

00:17:53.241 --> 00:17:55.491
Right. On the
night of the murder,

00:17:55.575 --> 00:17:57.825
there were, in fact,
two Irises on the scene.

00:17:57.908 --> 00:18:00.366
I gotta hear
your reasoning. Go on.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.366
To be more precise,
there was a pair of twins.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:05.158
--Your Honor!
--[JUDGE] Hmm?

00:18:05.241 --> 00:18:07.200
[PHOENIX] Think back to
a big case from years ago.

00:18:07.283 --> 00:18:08.450
Does she look familiar?

00:18:08.533 --> 00:18:09.991
[JUDGE]
Hmm.

00:18:11.866 --> 00:18:14.491
Hmm?

00:18:14.575 --> 00:18:17.116
[gasps]
Wait! Could it really be her?

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.533
Yes. Her twin sister

00:18:19.616 --> 00:18:21.700
is the murderer--
Dahlia Hawthorne.

00:18:21.783 --> 00:18:22.783
[CROWD gasping]

00:18:22.866 --> 00:18:24.241
Objection!

00:18:24.325 --> 00:18:26.033
Some strange brew.

00:18:26.116 --> 00:18:28.991
Considering Dahlia Hawthorne
was recently executed.

00:18:29.075 --> 00:18:32.533
[PHOENIX] Yeah. I heard that it
was carried out last month.

00:18:32.616 --> 00:18:34.033
Uh, she was?

00:18:34.116 --> 00:18:35.366
Yes, she's gone!

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:37.700
My sister's no longer
of this world!

00:18:37.783 --> 00:18:39.158
Not completely true.

00:18:39.241 --> 00:18:40.200
[gasping]

00:18:40.283 --> 00:18:41.366
Seriously.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.075
You of all people
should understand that.

00:18:44.158 --> 00:18:45.700
It's in your family.

00:18:45.783 --> 00:18:47.241
You're part of the
bloodline that makes up

00:18:47.325 --> 00:18:49.158
the Kurain School of Channeling.

00:18:49.241 --> 00:18:50.741
--[gasps]
--[CROWD murmuring]

00:18:50.825 --> 00:18:52.408
What? Channeling?

00:18:52.491 --> 00:18:56.116
[PHOENIX] By the way, why
didn't you mention it earlier?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.908
That the body was
moved by pendulum?

00:18:57.991 --> 00:18:59.783
[IRIS gulps]
Well, because...

00:18:59.866 --> 00:19:02.866
I, uh... I honestly had
no idea about that.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.741
It's true. I really didn't know.

00:19:05.825 --> 00:19:08.283
[PHOENIX]
It's obvious that you did know.

00:19:08.366 --> 00:19:10.866
Because you were the one
who received the body.

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.825
[IRIS whimpers]

00:19:12.908 --> 00:19:15.241
[PHOENIX] Something has
felt off to me today.

00:19:15.325 --> 00:19:18.783
A few things, really.
Your sudden confession,

00:19:18.866 --> 00:19:22.700
and your attempts to frame
Maya out of nowhere.

00:19:22.783 --> 00:19:25.033
[sighs] I believe you're
not actually Sister Iris.

00:19:25.116 --> 00:19:26.033
[gasps]

00:19:26.116 --> 00:19:27.366
It's strange.

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.825
Because I thought the day
would never come when

00:19:28.908 --> 00:19:31.450
we'd see each other again...

00:19:31.533 --> 00:19:33.033
...Dahlia Hawthorne.

00:19:33.116 --> 00:19:34.158
[growls]

00:19:34.241 --> 00:19:36.658
But... I thought she was dead.

00:19:36.741 --> 00:19:38.533
Didn't you just say
she was executed?

00:19:38.616 --> 00:19:42.033
Yes. This woman is not
Dahlia Hawthorne in the flesh.

00:19:42.116 --> 00:19:43.075
[gasps]

00:19:43.158 --> 00:19:45.616
She's currently
serving as a vessel.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.783
Dahlia's spirit is inside her.
She's been channeled!

00:19:48.866 --> 00:19:51.075
But... Can that really be true?

00:19:51.158 --> 00:19:52.991
[CROWD gasping]

00:19:53.075 --> 00:19:56.700
Everything is spelled
out here in these instructions.

00:19:56.783 --> 00:19:58.616
Dahlia Hawthorne was
to be channeled on

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.991
the night of the murder!

00:20:01.075 --> 00:20:02.325
It can't be...

00:20:02.408 --> 00:20:04.783
This was written by
your mother, Morgan Fey,

00:20:04.866 --> 00:20:06.991
--who's in jail right now!
--[PEARL gasps]

00:20:07.075 --> 00:20:09.200
[JUDGE]
I still don't understand!

00:20:09.283 --> 00:20:10.533
This hood is proof

00:20:10.616 --> 00:20:12.575
that a second Iris made
an appearance on the night

00:20:12.658 --> 00:20:14.533
of Misty Fey's murder.

00:20:14.616 --> 00:20:17.366
Before 10, I met her
at the main temple,

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.491
where she insisted
I take this hood.

00:20:19.575 --> 00:20:21.616
However, right after that,

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.825
Sister Bikini spoke to her
at the Inner Temple

00:20:24.908 --> 00:20:28.075
where she was wearing the same
hood she had just given away.

00:20:28.158 --> 00:20:29.491
That's quite a contradiction.

00:20:29.575 --> 00:20:31.908
--[IRIS growls]
--Objection!

00:20:31.991 --> 00:20:34.991
The witness has been in police
custody the entire time.

00:20:35.075 --> 00:20:37.366
So tell me, when could
she have switched places

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.741
with Dahlia Hawthorne?

00:20:39.825 --> 00:20:42.158
It was quick,
but she did have a chance.

00:20:42.241 --> 00:20:43.158
[GODOT gasps]

00:20:43.241 --> 00:20:45.241
Right? It was yesterday.

00:20:45.325 --> 00:20:47.283
When she went missing
for a few minutes.

00:20:47.366 --> 00:20:49.825
Right around the time
of the earthquake.

00:20:49.908 --> 00:20:51.200
Earthquake?

00:20:51.283 --> 00:20:52.908
[PHOENIX] She made a beeline
for the Inner temple,

00:20:52.991 --> 00:20:55.116
which is where we found
her moments later.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.991
But by then, the switch
had already taken place.

00:20:58.075 --> 00:21:00.741
And Dahlia was
in control of her.

00:21:00.825 --> 00:21:02.825
[JUDGE] But... If we were
to give credence to

00:21:02.908 --> 00:21:05.825
this channeling theory,
my question is this--

00:21:05.908 --> 00:21:06.825
Could we even have a--

00:21:06.908 --> 00:21:08.366
[IRIS (DAHLIA)]
Stop yammering.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.616
[JUDGE]
Hmm?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.533
[IRIS (DAHLIA)]
It's been a long time.

00:21:12.616 --> 00:21:13.991
Right, grandpa?

00:21:14.075 --> 00:21:17.741
That horrible attitude.
I remember it well.

00:21:17.825 --> 00:21:19.075
Okay, then.

00:21:19.158 --> 00:21:22.033
Seems we have to go through
this one more time.

00:21:22.116 --> 00:21:23.950
My curiosity and
courtroom procedures

00:21:24.033 --> 00:21:27.533
both require that I ask
your name and profession.

00:21:27.616 --> 00:21:31.658
My name is Dahlia Hawthorne
and I'm permanently retired.

00:21:31.741 --> 00:21:34.908
[CROWD gasping]

00:21:34.991 --> 00:21:38.075
Long time no see, Feenie.

00:21:38.158 --> 00:21:39.366
[PHOENIX growls]

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:41.408
[PHOENIX]
Dahlia Hawthorne!

00:21:41.491 --> 00:21:45.908
It's time to finish this
chapter of my life for good.

00:21:45.991 --> 00:21:49.283
To turn the page
on her and my past.

00:23:20.325 --> 00:23:21.575
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:23:21.658 --> 00:23:23.700
It's clear that Dahlia has
crossed over the void

00:23:23.783 --> 00:23:25.908
and taken over Iris's body.

00:23:25.991 --> 00:23:28.325
Now, she's going to take
this opportunity to finally

00:23:28.408 --> 00:23:32.116
reveal the horrifying plot that
she and Morgan Fey concocted.

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:35.450
In order to save Maya,
I reach a shocking conclusion.

00:23:35.533 --> 00:23:37.908
The trial enters
into its final stages.

00:23:37.991 --> 00:23:40.658
Very soon, the truth
will shine through.

00:23:40.741 --> 00:23:43.241
Find the contradictions!
Believe in the truth!

00:23:43.325 --> 00:23:46.408
Next episode, "Bridge to the
Turnabout--6th Trial"!

00:23:46.491 --> 00:23:47.658
Take that!
